    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Meet Your AI Collaborator\r\n\r\nWelcome to **Web Lab**! You'll build websites here by working with **AI Tutor** - you decide what the page should be, AI Tutor writes the code, and *you* judge the result.\r\n\r\nWe're starting with a practice page about otters. Your own page comes next.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1. **Pick a change** you'd like to see on the otter page. Some ideas:\r\n   - Add a new section about what otters eat\r\n   - Change the background to an orange and red gradient\r\n   - Give the whole page a more playful feel\r\n2. **Ask for it:** Tell AI Tutor what you want, in your own words.\r\n3. **Judge it:** Look at the preview. Is it what you asked for? If yes, click **Accept** - if not, click **Reject** and say what was off.\r\n\r\n> **Remember:** Nothing changes without your approval. You are the editor here.\r\n\r\nOnce you've accepted a change, click **Continue**.",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "true",
