    "offer_browser_tts": "true",
    "teacher_markdown": "**Intent:** First contact with the collaborate-evaluate loop: ask in your own words, judge the preview, Accept or Reject. The code workspace is hidden by default on every level in this lesson - students work entirely through the chat and the preview. The habit to establish here is judging the preview *against what was asked* before accepting.\r\n\r\n**Circulation questions:**\r\n\r\n- \"What did you ask for? Did you get exactly that?\"\r\n- \"Did you accept or reject? Why?\"\r\n\r\n**Expected mistakes and misconceptions:**\r\n\r\n- Students may accept without looking at the preview - redirect: \"before you accept, check: is that what you asked for?\"\r\n- Students may ask for many changes at once - encourage one change, then Continue\r\n",
    "require_edit_to_continue": "true"
  },
